{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:02IY:statement", "parent_tag": "02IV", "chapter": "properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a locally Noetherian scheme.\nThe following are equivalent:\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002> is catenary, and\n<STRUCT_0003> locally in the Zariski topology there exists a dimension function\non <MATH_0003> (see Topology, Definition <REF_0001>).\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "MATH_0003": "$S$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{topology-definition-dimension-function}", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-catenary-dimension-function}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:3c8b8b637f0fa18c36e1cd24d541b54926819c305b29162b3f7dc36f2a2d0c01", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7fe6f0bd494f887807182081adce148d7d24116f7757ffd3669cab3a06d26d5d", "source_math_hash": "sha256:e23f264061bb1f0c2a3e261205fa58fd93cc50d931282c2c6393f4ff9be13593"}
{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:02IY:proof", "parent_tag": "02IV", "chapter": "properties", "node_kind": "proof", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "This follows from\nTopology, Lemmas\n<REF_0001>,\n<REF_0002>, and\n<REF_0003>,\nSchemes, Lemma <REF_0004>\nand finally Lemma <REF_0005>.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{topology-lemma-catenary}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{topology-lemma-dimension-function-catenary}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{topology-lemma-locally-dimension-function}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{schemes-lemma-scheme-sober}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{lemma-Noetherian-topology}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:f23d58edad70d49fc375fbb5a046cd3f68fa70b3f721a2f777c16c0b00c86010", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:1e4eea88e5c192837b603fc0a79ef5c9974a5091a6b5fbb12f755accc679aa6a", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a"}
{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:02IV:prose-0003", "parent_tag": "02IV", "chapter": "properties", "node_kind": "paragraph", "risk_level": "R2", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIt turns out that a scheme is catenary if and only if its local\nrings are catenary.\n\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:6fd55d0cb82e38e8dc719a8b6fa2e9e26f8d08077841dd2a2eb661849dc3542f", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e4c0370294426118dad664b5c80723438772eb80daacec7830deb8369688d863", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a"}
{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:02J0:statement", "parent_tag": "02IV", "chapter": "properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme. The following are equivalent\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002> is catenary, and\n<STRUCT_0003> for any <MATH_0003> the local ring <MATH_0004> is\ncatenary.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "MATH_0002": "$X$", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "MATH_0003": "$x \\in X$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{O}_{X, x}$", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-catenary-local-rings-catenary}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:db33978b5797109f0c83f9151f587e5ae5cea00562f0b4e2651ed0bfd21aff5c", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:6ac02776c02f64e7822dfececc7cedf2b1ba1fa90f501510cf93ca555bb48561", "source_math_hash": "sha256:0b515d987589c88e5fc07f5a44ea77c737e6a62a14d49fc6dfa89bb0d6692a8a"}
{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:02J0:proof", "parent_tag": "02IV", "chapter": "properties", "node_kind": "proof", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "Assume <MATH_0001> is catenary. Let <MATH_0002>. By Lemma <REF_0001>\nwe may replace <MATH_0003> by an affine open neighbourhood of <MATH_0004>, and\nthen <MATH_0005> is a catenary ring. By\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0002> any\nlocalization of a catenary ring is\ncatenary. Whence <MATH_0006> is catenary.\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\nConversely assume all local rings of <MATH_0007> are catenary.\nLet <MATH_0008> be an inclusion of irreducible closed\nsubsets of <MATH_0009>. Let <MATH_0010> be the generic point.\nLet <MATH_0011> be the prime\ncorresponding to the generic point of <MATH_0012>, see\nSchemes, Lemma <REF_0003>. By that same\nlemma the irreducible closed subsets of <MATH_0013> in between <MATH_0014> and <MATH_0015>\ncorrespond to primes <MATH_0016>\nwith <MATH_0017>.\nHence we see all maximal chains of these are finite and have the\nsame length as <MATH_0018> is a catenary ring.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$x \\in X$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-catenary-local}", "MATH_0003": "$X$", "MATH_0004": "$x$", "MATH_0005": "$\\Gamma(X, \\mathcal{O}_X)$", "REF_0002": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-localization-catenary}", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{O}_{X, x}$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0002": "\\noindent", "MATH_0007": "$X$", "MATH_0008": "$Y \\subset Y'$", "MATH_0009": "$X$", "MATH_0010": "$\\xi \\in Y$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathfrak p \\subset \\mathcal{O}_{X, \\xi}$", "MATH_0012": "$Y'$", "REF_0003": "\\ref{schemes-lemma-specialize-points}", "MATH_0013": "$X$", "MATH_0014": "$Y$", "MATH_0015": "$Y'$", "MATH_0016": "$\\mathfrak q \\subset \\mathcal{O}_{X, \\xi}$", "MATH_0017": "$\\mathfrak p \\subset \\mathfrak q \\subset \\mathfrak m_{\\xi}$", "MATH_0018": "$\\mathcal{O}_{X, \\xi}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:351f48ea9da8ff0cefa5450c73b586b61b9af1d449ec613432f4661130c3a0a1", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:53f6087baa6a70ae6e7cd5e53289c4e2e685bff5e1f46381a60159b1cda37c20", "source_math_hash": "sha256:722b9cdb387aa45fe1a9109443752f5fc9b638475a023caa65085975e4134c86"}
